{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by a Cypriot legend, this linear single-player adventure unravels a tale of family, sacrifice, and redemption. Set within the depths of a massive, ancient cave, players must face mystical challenges, battle cursed undead pirates, and uncover secrets in a journey through a timeless story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes Within is a story-driven, third-person action-adventure game set in 1930s Cyprus. Blending horror, parkour, and shooter elements, it tells the story of a family torn apart by greed. Play as Ann, a silent witness to echoes that claw through sanity and drag her toward a forgotten nightmare.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835160?t=1755877336","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835160/521ee6c50a4c747ce923da57068084e50b395288/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755877336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835160/ec803a8174d5aff3173805be5e7ea3c11a6b084e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755877336","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835160/ec803a8174d5aff3173805be5e7ea3c11a6b084e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755877336","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Echoes Within contains depictions of psychological horror, blood, intense violence, and disturbing imagery. The game includes themes such as mental trauma, death, and supernatural fear that may be disturbing to some players.\r\nT